# Autograding Action Agent Rule

## Scope

This repository is the ExpertFlow GitHub Action that runs assignment autograding
tests and writes `autograding-results.json` for the grading pipeline. Prefer
changing behavior here over forking logic into the ExpertFlow app or Terraform
repos.

## Development

1. Run `npm ci` after dependency changes.
2. Run `npm run typecheck` and `npm test` before finishing.
3. Run `npm run build` and commit `dist/` when `src/` changes — the runner
   executes the committed bundle.
4. Keep the classroom test config schema compatible with existing templates
   (`.github/classroom/autograding.json`).

## Cross-repo docs

When inputs, outputs, results schema, or `template-workflow/` change, update
architecture docs in the ExpertFlow app (`docs/GradingPipeline.md`) and follow
the `document-grading-architecture` skill.
